cal fact output before/after at three corpus sizes (155/213/326 facts).\nFollow-up (stays on COR-2182)\nExport and the COR-2128 transcript reads still exec git per blob; batching via one long-lived git cat-file --batch process is the next step. After this fix, export is ~70% of first-run time.",
